 were out a full day. Woke up wanting to be useful.","I woke up in a clearing with eleven strangers and one a sailor — me. First thing I did was count heads — old sailor habit, I guess. All I wanted was to be useful.","We have to decide — Rimay says together, or starving separately. I'm a sailor, not a leader, but someone has to say it.","I'm Rimay. I keep the fire lit and the arguments short — learned that as a sailor. Both are full-time jobs.","Nobody here chose this. But everybody here chose to stay past the first night — Rimay counted. That counts for something. Me, I'm still hoping to be useful.","We found you on the Lima, Peru side of the clearing — Rimay was on watch. Someone carried you in. I know who; Rimay isn't telling."],"kcalPerDay":2332,"providesPerDay":1650,"survivalProbability":43,"systemAssessment":"Whatever happens, Rimay is still standing in the same place. People notice, and stand a little closer.","secretFear":"being forgotten","languages":{"native":"spanish","levels":{"spanish":2,"english":2},"reasons":["{They} learned English on the job as a sailor."]},"occupationId":"sailor","knowsSnare":false,"knowsPit":false,"candidate":false,"pro":"they","gender":null,"skinTone":"brown","clothing":"andean-weave poncho","itemPersonal":{"mixtape":{"name":"Mixtape","flavor":"Giancarlo made it. Hand-labeled: 'FOR THE DRIVE.' No player. The songs are in your head anyway.","kin":"friend","kinName":"Giancarlo Saavedra"},"lucky_coin":{"name":"Lucky Coin","flavor":"Ramiro Ponce, your grandfather: worked the regional hospital and never complained.","kin":"grandfather","kinName":"Ramiro Ponce"},"dog_tags":{"name":"Dog Tags","flavor":"Pedro Lévano, your friend: was supposed to visit that spring.","kin":"friend","kinName":"Pedro Lévano"}},"fullPool":["dog_tags","lucky_coin","trail_compass","boot_stone","dispatchers_headset","binoculars","hatchet","rain_shell"],"stashed":["hatchet","rain_shell","binoculars"],"keepsakeOwner":{"mixtape":"gen_i7lj0zf","lucky_coin":"gen_i7l